            }
          },
          {
            "fact_id": "fact_511b5ccbe0c6179b",
            "text": "An influential (I) personality who is outgoing and people-oriented may have difficulty working with a conscientious (C) personality who is analytical and precise because the influential personality may feel frustrated by the conscientious personality's lack of social skills.",
